s/TextColorTextGenerator Syntax Error: Mismatched brackets on replacement block: TextGenerator Syntax Error: Missing closing bracket on replacement block: TextInfo - TextMeshProTextMeshPro - InputFieldTextMeshPro/TextMeshPro/Distance FieldTextMeshPro/SpriteTextOnlyTextureTexture Texture 'Texture '{0}' is not readable, the texture memory can not be accessed from scripts. You can make the texture readable in the Texture Import Settings.Texture Quality:Texture creation failed. '{0}' is not supported for {1} usage on this platform. Use 'SystemInfo.IsFormatSupported' C# API to check format support.Texture creation failed. '{0}' is not supported on this platform. Use 'SystemInfo.SupportsTextureFormat' C# API to check format support.Texture load error for craft Texture load error in Texture load error in 'Texture resolution is not valid for compression: 'Texture: TextureConfigTextureError: TexturePathTexturesTfTgTThThaiThai (Thailand)That name specifies an existing directory. Please specify a filename.That's one small step for a kerbal, one giant leap for kerbalkindThat's right! That trajectory looks great. It's going to be quite a burn, some 2 - 3 minutes most likely so make sure you plan your times right, remember that you want to burn half before and half after the node for efficiency.

After the burn you may or may not get exactly the desired result, it's okay, it's quite an amazing feat to set a interplanetary landing course in just one maneuver, even for the more skilled. So we're going to set up a correction node, since your orbit and Duna's are not exactly aligned I suggest you put it on the Descending Node and adjust your Normal and Radial vectors slightly. 
