The maximum speed is the speed the autopilot tries to reach to get to the waypoint.

The minimum speed was before used to set the speed with which the autopilot will go through the waypoint, but that got reworked now to be based on the next waypoint's max. speed and the turn needed at the waypoint.

I have no idea what this will currently do if set so better just leave it at 0...

